␀␀␀%.*f␀␀␀␀&amp;␀␀␀&lt;␀␀␀␀&gt;␀␀␀␀&quot;␀␀&#39;␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>␀␀␀␀</span><span class='v'>␀</span></div>␀␀␀basic_string::_M_replace␀␀␀␀basic_string::replace␀␀␀%s: __pos (which is %zu) > this->size() (which is %zu)␀␀<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>openHop Modem Setup</title><style>body{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:480px;margin:1em auto;padding:0 1em;color:#222}h1{font-size:1.3em}label{display:block;margin-top:1em;font-weight:600}input,select{width:100%;padding:.5em;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:1em}input[type=checkbox]{width:auto;margin-right:.5em}button{margin-top:1.5em;padding:.75em;width:100%;background:#3a7;color:#fff;border:0;font-size:1em;border-radius:4px}.hint{color:#666;font-size:.85em;font-weight:400}hr{margin:2em 0;border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd}</style></head><body><h1>openHop Modem Setup</h1><form method='POST' action='/save'><label>Wi-Fi SSID</label><select name='ssid'><option value=''>-- select --</option>␀␀␀<option value='␀ selected␀␀␀ dBm)</option>␀␀</select><label>or manual SSID <span class='hint'>(overrides dropdown)</span></label><input type='text' name='ssid_manual' autocomplete='off'><label>Wi-Fi password</label><input type='password' name='password' value='␀␀␀<label><input type='checkbox' name='wifi_ant_ext' value='1'␀> Use external Wi-Fi antenna</label>␀␀␀␀ checked␀␀␀␀<label><input type='checkbox' name='v43_lna_on' value='1'␀␀␀> Enable Heltec V4.3 external FEM RX LNA <span class='hint'>(RX only; TX always bypasses LNA)</span></label><label>agc.reset.interval seconds <span class='hint'>(0 disables; periodically resets AGC during long idle periods)</span><input name='agc_reset_interval_sec' type='number' min='0' max='3600' step='1' value='␀␀␀␀'></label>␀␀<label><input type='checkbox' name='static' value='1'␀␀␀> Use static IP (otherwise DHCP)</label><label>Static IP</label><input type='text' name='ip' value='␀␀␀␀' placeholder='192.168.1.42'><label>Gateway</label><input type='text' name='gw' value='␀' placeholder='192.168.1.1'><label>Subnet mask</label><input type='text' name='sn' value='␀␀' placeholder='255.255.255.0'><label>DNS 1</label><input type='text' name='dns1' value='␀␀␀␀' placeholder='1.1.1.1'><label>DNS 2</label><input type='text' name='dns2' value='␀␀' placeholder='8.8.8.8'><hr><label>Hostname <span class='hint'>(optional; blank = default mDNS name)</span></label><input type='text' name='hostname' autocomplete='off' maxlength='32' value='␀' placeholder='ethermesh-1w'><label>TCP port</label><input type='number' name='port' min='1' max='65535' value='␀␀␀␀'><label>TCP auth token <span class='hint'>(optional; empty = no auth)</span></label><input type='text' name='token' autocomplete='off' value='␀'><button type='submit'>Save &amp; Restart</button></form></body></html>␀␀␀␀waiting␀no fix␀␀Static␀␀DHCP␀␀␀␀External␀␀␀␀Internal␀␀␀␀Enabled␀Bypassed␀␀␀␀<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><meta http-equiv='refresh' content='5'><title>Modem Stats</title><style>body{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:760px;margin:1.25em auto;padding:0 1em;color:#222;line-height:1.45}h2{margin:.2em 0 .35em}h3{margin:1.2em 0 .45em}.m{color:#666;font-size:.92em}.card{background:#f7f7f7;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:8px;padding:.8em 1em;margin:1em 0}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:.75em 1em}.kv{border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;padding:.7em .8em}.k{display:block;color:#666;font-size:.9em;margin-bottom:.2em}.v{font-weight:600}.actions{margin:1em 0}.actions a{margin-right:1em}code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace;background:#f3f3f3;padding:.1em .35em;border-radius:4px}@media (max-width:640px){body{padding:0 .75em}}</style></head><body><h2>␀␀␀ Stats</h2><div class='actions'><a href='/'>Back to main page</a></div><p class='m'>Auto-refreshes every 5 seconds.</p><div class='card'><div class='grid'>␀Firmware␀␀␀␀Hostname␀␀␀␀Current IP␀␀Connected client␀␀␀␀Interface␀␀␀ dBm␀␀␀␀Wi-Fi signal␀␀␀␀Ethernet link␀␀␀TCP status␀␀Uptime␀␀ V␀␀Battery␀ %/hr␀␀␀Battery charge rate␀GPS fix␀GPS location␀␀␀␀</div></div>␀␀␀␀<h3>Counters</h3><div class='grid'>␀<h3>Radio</h3><div class='grid'>␀␀␀␀State␀␀␀ MHz␀␀␀␀Frequency␀␀␀ kHz␀␀␀␀SF␀␀Spreading factor␀␀␀␀4/␀␀Coding rate␀TX power␀␀␀␀0x%x␀␀␀␀Syncword␀␀␀␀Preamble␀␀␀␀RX packets␀␀TX packets␀␀CRC errors␀␀Last RSSI␀␀␀ dB␀Last SNR␀␀␀␀Noise floor␀ C␀␀Die temperature␀</div><h3>Network</h3><div class='grid'>␀␀␀␀Port␀␀␀␀Wi-Fi RSSI␀␀Wi-Fi antenna␀␀␀Heltec V4.3 external LNA␀␀␀␀Subnet␀␀DNS 1␀␀␀DNS 2␀␀␀</div></body></html>␀␀␀␀openHop protected␀␀␀openHop open␀␀␀␀Static network saved␀␀␀␀DHCP mode␀␀␀mDNS / OTA hostname the modem advertises on the network.␀␀␀␀hostname shown by the modem on the network.␀mDNS / OTA hostname␀Protected␀␀␀Static mode is saved. These values are what the modem will use after reboot.␀␀␀␀DHCP is active. These fields show the live lease from ␀␀DHCP is active. No live lease is available yet, so the fields are blank.␀␀␀␀</title><style>body{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:760px;margin:1.25em auto;padding:0 1em;color:#222;line-height:1.45}h2{margin:.2em 0 .35em}p{margin:.45em 0}.m{color:#666;font-size:.92em}.summary{background:#f7f7f7;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:8px;padding:.8em 1em;margin:1em 0 1.2em}.summary strong{display:inline-block;min-width:4.5em}.chips{margin-top:.55em}.chip{display:inline-block;background:#efefef;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:999px;padding:.2em .6em;margin:0 .35em .35em 0;font-size:.9em}details{border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:8px;padding:.65em .8em;margin:0 0 .9em;background:#fff}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;list-style:none}summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.inside{margin-top:.8em}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:.75em 1em}label{display:block;margin-top:.8em;font-weight:600}input{width:100%;padding:.55em;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:1em;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:6px}input[type=file]{padding:.3em 0;border:0}input[type=checkbox]{width:auto;margin-right:.45em}.checkline{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.35em;margin-top:.8em}button{margin-top:.9em;padding:.6em 1em;background:#2f6f5e;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer}button.danger{background:#b3261e}button:disabled{background:#999;cursor:not-allowed}code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace;background:#f3f3f3;padding:.1em .35em;border-radius:4px}@media (max-width:640px){body{padding:0 .75em}}</style></head><body><h2>␀␀␀</h2><div class='summary'>␀␀<p><strong>mDNS</strong> ␀␀␀.local</p>␀␀<p><strong>Hostname</strong> ␀␀␀</p>␀␀␀␀<p><strong>IP</strong> ␀</p><p><strong>Interface</strong> ␀␀</p><p><strong>Current connection</strong> ␀<p><strong>Link</strong> ␀␀␀</p><p><strong>MAC</strong> ␀␀␀␀</p><p><strong>TCP status</strong> ␀<div class='chips'><span class='chip'>␀␀</span><span class='chip'>␀␀</span></div><p class='m'><a href='/stats'>View stats page</a></p></div>␀␀␀␀<details open><summary>OTA Update</summary><div class='inside'><p>Upload an app-only <code>firmware.bin</code> over the LAN.</p><form method='POST' action='/update' enctype='multipart/form-data'><input type='file' name='firmware' accept='.bin' required><br><button type='submit'>Upload firmware.bin</button></form><p class='m'>CLI alternative: <code>curl -u admin:&lt;password&gt; -F firmware=@firmware.bin http://␀␀/update</code></p></div></details>␀␀Firmware update is unavailable on this platform.␀␀␀␀<details open><summary>Ethernet OTA unavailable</summary><div class='inside'><p>␀␀␀␀</p><button type='button' disabled>Firmware update unavailable</button></div></details>␀<details open><summary>Network Status</summary><div class='inside'><div class='grid'>␀␀␀</div></div></details>␀␀<details><summary>Hostname</summary><div class='inside'><p>Controls the ␀␀␀␀</p><form method='POST' action='/hostname' data-reboot-save='hostname'><label>␀␀</label><input type='text' name='hostname' autocomplete='off' maxlength='64' value='␀␀␀␀' placeholder='leave blank for default'><button type='submit'>Save hostname</button></form><p class='m'>Blank resets to the board default. Reboot required.</p></div></details>␀<details><summary>Network</summary><div class='inside'><p>␀␀</p><form method='POST' action='/network' data-reboot-save='network'><div class='checkline'><input type='checkbox' id='static' name='static' value='1'␀␀><label for='static'>Use static IP instead of DHCP</label></div><div class='grid'><div><label>Static IP</label><input type='text' name='ip' value='␀' placeholder='192.168.1.42'></div><div><label>Subnet mask</label><input type='text' name='sn' value='␀␀' placeholder='255.255.255.0'></div><div><label>Gateway</label><input type='text' name='gw' value='␀' placeholder='192.168.1.1'></div><div><label>DNS 1</label><input type='text' name='dns1' value='␀␀␀' placeholder='1.1.1.1'></div><div><label>DNS 2</label><input type='text' name='dns2' value='␀␀␀' placeholder='8.8.8.8'></div><div><label>Current source</label><div class='chip'>␀␀</div></div></div>␀␀<div class='grid'><div><label>Link</label><div class='chip'>␀␀␀␀</div></div><div><label>MAC</label><div class='chip'>␀␀␀</div></div><div><label>TCP status</label><div class='chip'>␀␀␀␀<div class='checkline'><input type='checkbox' id='wifi_ant_ext' name='wifi_ant_ext' value='1'␀␀␀><label for='wifi_ant_ext'>Use external Wi-Fi antenna</label></div>␀<label>openHop TCP port</label><input type='number' name='port' min='1' max='65535' value='␀'><p class='m'>Port 80 is reserved for this management server.</p><button type='submit'>Save network settings</button></form></div></details>␀␀␀<details open><summary>Heltec V4.3 RF Front-End</summary><div class='inside'><p>Toggle the KCT8103L external RX LNA for receive only. The firmware always bypasses the FEM LNA during transmit so the TX path remains available.</p><form method='POST' action='/rf-lna'><div class='checkline'><input type='checkbox' id='v43_lna_on' name='v43_lna_on' value='1'␀␀><label for='v43_lna_on'>Enable external FEM RX LNA</label></div><label>agc.reset.interval (seconds, 0 disables)<input name='agc_reset_interval_sec' type='number' min='0' max='3600' step='1' value='␀␀'></label><p class='m'>Periodically restarts RX gain control during long idle periods to prevent strong out-of-band interference from clamping the noise floor.</p><button type='submit'>Save RF front-end settings</button></form><p class='m'>Settings apply immediately and persist across reboots. Unchecked LNA = GPIO5/CTX HIGH, external LNA bypassed.</p></div></details>␀␀␀<details open><summary>GPS</summary><div class='inside'><p>Turn the onboard GPS receiver interface on only when location data is needed. Default is off to save battery.</p><form method='POST' action='/gps'><div class='checkline'><input type='checkbox' id='gps_enabled' name='gps_enabled' value='1'␀␀␀><label for='gps_enabled'>Enable GPS</label></div><button type='submit'>Save GPS setting</button></form><p class='m'>Saved atomically and applied after reboot.</p></div></details>␀<details open><summary>Device Status</summary><div class='inside'><div class='grid'>␀␀␀␀<details><summary>openHop Token</summary><div class='inside'><p>This token must match the <code>token</code> value in openHop so openHop can connect to the radio.</p><form method='POST' action='/token'><label>New openHop token</label><input type='password' name='token' autocomplete='new-password' maxlength='64'><label>Confirm openHop token</label><input type='password' name='confirm' autocomplete='new-password' maxlength='64'><button type='submit'>Save openHop token</button></form><p class='m'>Current mode: <span class='chip'>␀␀␀␀</span>. Leave both fields blank to clear it. Reboot required.</p></div></details><details><summary>HTTP Password</summary><div class='inside'><p>Protects this web page and management actions. Username: <code>admin</code>.</p><form method='POST' action='/auth'><label>New password</label><input type='password' name='password' autocomplete='new-password' required minlength='1' maxlength='64'><label>Confirm password</label><input type='password' name='confirm' autocomplete='new-password' required minlength='1' maxlength='64'><button type='submit'>Save password</button></form><p class='m'>Password changes take effect on the next request.</p></div></details>␀␀␀<details><summary>Wi-Fi Setup Mode</summary><div class='inside'><p>Clear the saved modem configuration and reboot into the open <code>openHop-Modem-XXXX</code> setup AP.</p><form method='POST' action='/wifi-reset' onsubmit="return confirm('Clear saved modem configuration and reboot into Wi-Fi setup AP?');"><button class='danger' type='submit'>Enter Wi-Fi Setup Mode</button></form><p class='m'>Use this before moving the modem to a different Wi-Fi network.</p></div></details>␀␀<details><summary>Reboot</summary><div class='inside'><p>Restart the modem without changing any settings.</p><form method='POST' action='/reboot'><button type='submit'>Reboot modem</button></form></div></details>␀␀␀␀<details><summary>Bluetooth DFU</summary><div class='inside'><p>Enter the installed Nordic Bluetooth DFU bootloader. Ethernet and port 5055 will disconnect. Then use a Nordic-compatible DFU app to select <code>4631_DFU</code> and upload the nRF52 <code>firmware.zip</code>.</p>␀␀␀<p class='m'>Expected <code>4631_DFU</code> address: <code>␀</code>. The DFU bootloader advertises an address different from the application address.</p>␀␀␀<form method='POST' action='/dfu/ble' onsubmit="return confirm('Enter Bluetooth DFU? Ethernet and port 5055 will disconnect until DFU completes or the device resets.');"><button class='danger' type='submit'>Enter Bluetooth DFU</button></form><p class='m'>This action only enters DFU mode; it does not upload firmware over Ethernet.</p></div></details>␀<div id='save-status' class='summary' hidden></div><script>(()=>{for(const form of document.querySelectorAll('form[data-reboot-save]')){form.addEventListener('submit',async event=>{event.preventDefault();const fields=new FormData(form);let target=location.origin+'/';if(form.dataset.rebootSave==='network'&&fields.has('static')){const ip=String(fields.get('ip')||'').trim();if(ip)target=location.protocol+'//'+ip+'/';}const status=document.getElementById('save-status');status.hidden=false;status.textContent='Saving settings...';for(const button of form.querySelectorAll('button'))button.disabled=true;try{const response=await fetch(form.action,{method:'POST',body:new URLSearchParams(new FormData(form)),credentials:'same-origin'});const message=await response.text();if(!response.ok)throw new Error(message||('HTTP '+response.status));status.textContent='Settings saved. Modem is rebooting. Returning to the main page...';setTimeout(()=>location.replace(target),7000);}catch(error){status.textContent='Save failed: '+error.message;for(const button of form.querySelectorAll('button'))button.disabled=false;}});}})();</script>␀</body></html>␀␀ssid␀␀␀␀pass␀␀␀␀host␀␀␀␀dns␀ant_ext␀gps_en␀␀%s-%02x%02x%02x␀%02x␀␀␀␀uart_event_task␀nan␀i2c.master␀␀i2c_slave_task␀␀clk_cal->scl_wait_high < clk_cal->sda_sample && clk_cal->sda_sample < clk_cal->scl_high␀/home/yellowcooln/.platformio/packages/framework-arduinoespressif32-libs/esp32p4_es/include/hal/esp32p4/include/hal/i2c_ll.h␀␀␀␀INIT␀␀␀␀GPIO␀␀␀␀UART_RX␀UART_TX␀UART_CTS␀␀␀␀UART_RTS␀␀␀␀SIGMADELTA␀␀ADC_ONESHOT␀ADC_CONT␀␀␀␀LEDC␀␀␀␀RMT_TX␀␀RMT_RX␀␀I2S_STD_MCLK␀␀␀␀I2S_STD_BCLK␀␀␀␀I2S_STD_WS␀␀I2S_STD_DOUT␀␀␀␀I2S_STD_DIN␀I2S_TDM_MCLK␀␀␀␀I2S_TDM_BCLK␀␀␀␀I2S_TDM_WS␀␀I2S_TDM_DOUT␀␀␀␀I2S_TDM_DIN␀I2S_PDM_TX_CLK␀␀I2S_PDM_TX_DOUT0␀␀␀␀I2S_PDM_TX_DOUT1␀␀␀␀I2S_PDM_RX_CLK␀␀I2S_PDM_RX_DIN0␀I2S_PDM_RX_DIN1␀I2S_PDM_RX_DIN2␀I2S_PDM_RX_DIN3␀I2C_MASTER_SDA␀␀I2C_MASTER_SCL␀␀I2C_SLAVE_SDA␀␀␀I2C_SLAVE_SCL␀␀␀SPI_MASTER_SCK␀␀SPI_MASTER_MISO␀SPI_MASTER_MOSI␀SPI_MASTER_SS␀␀␀SDMMC_CLK␀␀␀SDMMC_CMD␀␀␀SDMMC